# Mobile UI Stack (BookMyBarber-App)

Use this stack for **all new** mobile UI work. Legacy screens may still use `StyleSheet`; migrate incrementally.

## Framework

- **Expo** (managed workflow) + **Expo Router** — file-based routes under `src/app/`
- Do not add React Navigation stacks outside expo-router unless required for a modal flow

## Styling

- **NativeWind v4** — use `className` on `View`, `Text`, `Pressable`, etc.
- **Design system:** [`design-system.mdc`](./design-system.mdc) + [`docs/design-system/`](../../docs/design-system/) (Elegant Terracotta tokens)
- **Do not** add new `StyleSheet.create` blocks for greenfield screens
- Global CSS entry: `import '@/global.css'` in `src/app/_layout.tsx` only

## Animations

- **Moti** (`moti`) for declarative enter/exit and micro-interactions
- **react-native-reanimated** under the hood — Reanimated Babel plugin must stay **last** in `babel.config.js`
- Prefer `@/components/ui/moti-fade-in` or `MotiView` over React Native `Animated`

## Gestures

- **react-native-gesture-handler** — root is wrapped in `GestureHandlerRootView` in `_layout.tsx`
- Use RNGH for swipes, pans, and future bottom sheets

## Premium primitives (reuse)

| Component | Import | Use for |
|-----------|--------|---------|
| `HapticPressable` | `@/components/ui` | Tappable CTAs (`haptic="medium"` on primary buttons) |
| `GlassSurface` | `@/components/ui` | Frosted panels, modals, overlays (iOS glass + blur fallback) |
| `MotiFadeIn` | `@/components/ui` | Screen/section fade-in |
| `appAlert` | `@/lib/app-alert` | Errors, success, validation — **not** `Alert.alert` |
| `AppDialog` / `AppDialogProvider` | `@/components/ui`, `@/contexts/app-dialog` | Modal feedback (wired in `_layout.tsx`) |

## Forbidden in mobile client

Same as `api-architecture.mdc`:

- `@supabase/supabase-js`, Stripe, `@sfpy/node-core`
- `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_*`, `SAFEPAY_*`
- Direct Supabase or SafePay API calls — use `src/lib/api.ts`, `auth.ts`, `payments.ts`
- `Alert.alert` / `alert()` for user messages — use `appAlert` per design-system § Dialogs

## After nativewind/babel/metro changes

```bash
cd BookMyBarber-App && npx expo start -c
```
